  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62404,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 98,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "<p>Neuroectodermal cysts are simple thin-walled cysts filled with clear yellow fluid, ranging from 8 to 15&nbsp;cm. Epidermoid cysts are also simple thin-walled cysts, but they contain whitish-grey cheesy material and may be as small as 1&nbsp;cm, ranging up to 15&nbsp;cm.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-03T10:41:01"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62405,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 98,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Neuroectodermal cysts are lined by ependymal cells and may exhibit choroid plexus&ndash;like epithelium along the cyst lining {8088721; 26261871; 2373589}. Astrocytes, oligodendrocytes, microglia, and ganglion cells may be present adjacent to the cyst lining. Epidermoid cysts are lined by mature, often keratinizing, stratified squamous epithelium and are surrounded by a rim of collagenous stroma containing fibroblasts. Keratinaceous debris fills the cyst lumen {8852449; 943942; 7355867}. Rare cysts lined purely by respiratory-type epithelium have been reported {6866875; 761172}. Prolactinomas show closely packed nests of small cells with eosinophilic cytoplasm as seen in anterior hypophysis {2304732}; corticotroph adenoma is composed of monomorphous cells with round nuclei and vacuolated or eosinophilic cytoplasm, growing in nests or cords {3548446}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T17:56:01"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
